{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02745","headline":"中和乐九章 歌登封第一 · 卢照邻","name":"中和乐九章 歌登封第一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎图丧宝，黄历开璿。\n祖武类帝，宗文配天。\n玉銮垂日，翠华陵烟。\n东云干吕，南风入弦。\n山称万岁，河庆千年。\n金绳永结，璧丽长悬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}